  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernisation of Irrigation Techniques to Improve the Livelihoods of Smallholder Farmers in Upper Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will contribute to improving the livelihoods and resilience of vulnerable rural people of the Upper Egypt Region by increasing agricultural production through the transformation from inefficient conventional irrigation practices to collective farming systems and modern smart irrigation techniques. In this context, the Project will contribute significantly to: (i) the Government of Egypt&apos;s Sustainable Development Strategy: Egypt Vision 2030 (SDS-2030) and Egypt Sustainable Agricultural Development Strategy (SADS-2030); (ii) Government of Netherlands Multi-Annual Country Strategy for Egypt (2019-2022); (iii) FAOs Strategic Pathways for Better Production and Better Environment; and (iv) SDGs 1, 2, 5, 6, 8 and 15.</narrative>
  </description>
